<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  uvc_cameras.xml  –  PHD2 UVC / V4L2 camera database
  =====================================================
  Maps USB Vendor ID + Product ID to sensor name and pixel size.

  Fields:
    usb_vendor_id  : USB vendor ID  (hex with 0x prefix, or decimal)
    usb_product_id : USB product ID (hex with 0x prefix, or decimal)
    name           : Human-readable camera name (shown in PHD2 UI)
    sensor         : Image sensor part number / name
    pixel_size_um  : Physical pixel pitch in micrometers (µm).
                     Set to 0 or omit if unknown.

  To contribute an entry, open a pull request against the PHD2 repository.
  Sources: manufacturer data sheets, CMOS sensor data sheets, EOSHD/CloudyNights
  measurement threads.
-->
